      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777273464415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ever significantly different when accessed through the object origin and the pointer pt?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ever significantly different when accessed through the object origin and the pointer pt?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s5_g8q1CEQl_Z79YP4i4g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 747.8928571428572,
      "y": -412.8690476190477,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3it",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 548287351,
      "version": 379,
      "versionNonce": 1546710263,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777290507479,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// origin.chunkSize == 250;\nPoint3d::chunkSize == 250;\n// pt->chunkSize == 250;\nPoint3d::chunkSize == 250;",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// origin.chunkSize == 250;\nPoint3d::chunkSize == 250;\n// pt->chunkSize == 250;\nPoint3d::chunkSize == 250;",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uqTqM07oZ-snswfcjcJRe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 751.6428571428572,
      "y": -450.3690476190477,
      "width": 189.67977905273438,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3ix",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1243179289,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 196002841,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777273464415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Static Data Members",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Static Data Members",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qRK81ZAySgI1SK5pCXbc0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 751.6428571428572,
      "y": -304.1190476190477,
      "width": 583.6395874023438,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3iz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 811508247,
      "version": 186,
      "versionNonce": 1095817465,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777273464415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each member's access permission and class association is\nmaintained without incurring any space or runtime overhead \neither in the individual class objects or in the static data \nmember itself.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each member's access permission and class association is\nmaintained without incurring any space or runtime overhead \neither in the individual class objects or in the static data \nmember itself.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "guVnwK97hUaNJ-dJ-gHpd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 751.6428571428572,
      "y": -197.8690476190477,
      "width": 374,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 907276761,
      "version": 63,
      "versionNonce": 1112229367,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777290512924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "&Point3d::chunkSize; // const int*",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "&Point3d::chunkSize; // const int*",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TisbOxtf73FcAt3LcEW2D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 745.3928571428572,
      "y": -169.1190476190477,
      "width": 621.259521484375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 45393463,
      "version": 81,
      "versionNonce": 61320889,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777273464415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Taking the address of a static data member yields an ordinary \npointer of its data type, not a pointer to class member, since\n the static member is not contained within a class object.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Taking the address of a static data member yields an ordinary \npointer of its data type, not a pointer to class member, since\n the static member is not contained within a class object.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M4MpWNhrxOeruDnKkgI8q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1379.1428571428573,
      "y": -401.6190476190477,
      "width": 811.9794311523438,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1859575671,
      "version": 212,
      "versionNonce": 49180409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777276203107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nonstatic data members are stored directly within each class object and cannot be\naccessed except through an explicit or implicit class object(this pointer).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nonstatic data members are stored directly within each class object and cannot be\naccessed except through an explicit or implicit class object(this pointer).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M_yLmG9cPFLz-V4l_cezn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1375.3928571428573,
      "y": -344.1190476190477,
      "width": 834.8794555664062,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 981937655,
      "version": 139,
      "versionNonce": 1293428697,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777276203107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Access of a nonstatic data member requires the addition of the beginning address of\nthe class object with the offset location of the data member.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Access of a nonstatic data member requires the addition of the beginning address of\nthe class object with the offset location of the data member.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9L5-_CxEarYDAX_6MohIq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1376.6428571428573,
      "y": -284.1190476190477,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izzV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1887103033,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 1946106263,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777290501282,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "&origin._y // &origin + ( &Point3d::_y - 1 );",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "&origin._y // &origin + ( &Point3d::_y - 1 );",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ixTS9Uy0GWuHm8l3BwjJA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1379.1428571428573,
      "y": -252.8690476190477,
      "width": 851.119384765625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izzl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 394481111,
      "version": 157,
      "versionNonce": 1162921369,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777276203107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notice the peculiar \"subtract by one\" expression applied to the pointer-to-data member\noffset value. to distinguish between a pointer to data member that is addressing the\nfirst member of a class and a pointer to data member that is addressing no member.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notice the peculiar \"subtract by one\" expression applied to the pointer-to-data member\noffset value. to distinguish between a pointer to data member that is addressing the\nfirst member of a class and a pointer to data member that is addressing no member.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Y85tfW2qedUz894JQ70gX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1381.6428571428573,
      "y": -166.6190476190477,
      "width": 783.219482421875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 370386583,
      "version": 155,
      "versionNonce": 1245096569,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777276203107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The offset of each nonstatic data member is known at compile time, even if the\nmember belongs to a base class subobject derived through a single or multiple\ninheritance chain.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The offset of each nonstatic data member is known at compile time, even if the\nmember belongs to a base class subobject derived through a single or multiple\ninheritance chain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MeoZF-x5InQLnYliatQ74",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1384.1428571428573,
      "y": -85.3690476190477,
      "width": 806.9193115234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izzx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 585231833,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 114094937,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777276203107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Virtual inheritance introduces an additional level of indirection in the access of its\nmembers through a base class subobject.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Virtual inheritance introduces an additional level of indirection in the access of its\nmembers through a base class subobject.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aPUuN-gyimMiFbrqRI-fJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 435.3928571428572,
      "y": -14.119047619047706,
      "width": 1798.0194091796875,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "EPvOzwiAxuTM0yHHErEJm",
      "index": "b3izzz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1846489207,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 1127950553,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777273464415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The answer is the access is significantly different when the Point3d class is a derived class containing a virtual base class within its inheritance hierarchy and the member being\naccessed, such as x, is an inherited member of that virtual base class. In this case, we cannot say with any certainty which class type pt addresses (and therefore we cannot know\nat compile time the actual offset location of the member), so the resolution of the access must be delayed until runtime through an additional indirection. This is not the case with\nthe object origin. Its type is that of a Point3d class, and the offset location of even inherited virtual base class members are fixed at compile time. An aggressive compiler can\ntherefore resolve the access of x through origin statically.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The answer is the access is significantly different when the Point3d class is a derived class containing a virtual base class within its inheritance hierarchy and the member being accessed, such as x, is an inherited member of that virtual base class. In this case, we cannot say with any certainty which class type pt addresses (and therefore we cannot know at compile time the actual offset location of the member), so the resolution of the access must be delayed until runtime through an additional indirection. This is not the case with the object origin. Its type is that of a Point3d class, and the offset location of even inherited virtual base class members are fixed at compile time. An aggressive compiler can therefore resolve the access of x through origin statically.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
