      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class Point3d {\npublic:\n// ...\nprivate:\nfloat x;\nstatic List<Point3d*> *freeList;\nfloat y;\nstatic const int chunkSize = 250;\nfloat z;\n};\n\nPoint3d origin, *pt = &origin;\norigin.x = 0.0;\npt->x = 0.0;",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
